OL,3,GNEWSASecond murder arrest after fatal
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a teenager
OL,8,Fdied following a crash.
OL,10,FBedfordshire Police were called to
OL,11,FDallow Road in Luton at about 22:50 BST
OL,12,Fon Friday to reports of a collision
OL,13,Fbetween a car and an e-bike.
OL,15,FThey found a 19-year-old with serious
OL,16,Finjuries, but despite the actions of
OL,17,Femergency services, he was pronounced
OL,18,Fdead shortly after.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
